            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ishikanwa ry’umuntu ni ryaba ar’ ikimazi c’ishimwe akūye mu busho, ar’ imasa cank’ inyana, az’ agitange kitagira agasembga imbere yanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aheze arambike ikiganza mu ruhanga rw’iryo shikanwa ryiwe ry’ikimazi, agikererere ku muryango w’ihema ry’ibonaniro: bene Aroni abaherezi baheze bamijagire amaraso yaco ku gicaniro impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 29:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ico kimazi ciwe c’ishimwe agikūrekw ishikanwa anshikanira ryo gutōngōrwa n’umuriro, ribe urubambanda rwōrōshe amara, n’ibinure vyose bihometse ku mara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "n’amafyigo yompi, n’ ibinure bihometse kuri yo, ahahereranye n’umurya, n’agashami gatoya k’igitigu, agakūrane n’ amafyigo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.6.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 6:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bene Aroni baheze bavyosereze ku gicaniro, babigeretse ku kimazi coswa kiri ku nkwi ziri ku muriro: ivyo bizoba ikimazi gitōngōrwa n’umuriro, umubabge ummotera neza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
