          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ishikanwa ryiwe ry’ ikimazi c’ishimwe anshikaniye, ni caba ar’ ico akūye mu mukuku, ar’ isuguru cank’ ishashi, az’ agitange kitagira agasembga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni yatanga umwana w’intama kw ishikanwa ryiwe, az’ awuzane imbere yanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aheze arambike ikiganza mu ruhanga rw’iryo shikanwa ryiwe ry’ikimazi, agikererere imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro: bene Aroni baheze bamijagire amaraso yaco ku gicaniro impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ ico kimazi ciwe c’ishimwe agikūrekw ishikanwa anshikanira ryo gutōngōrwa n’umuriro, ribe ibinure vy’uwo mwana w’intama; umurizo wawo uko wagahometsekw ibinure, az’ awucire mu nguge udasonōye, n’urubambanda rwōrōshe amara, n’ibinure vyose bihometse ku mara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
