          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aheze arambike ikiganza mu ruhanga rwayo, ayikererere imbere y’ihema ry’ibonaniro: bene Aroni baheze bamijagire amaraso yayo ku gicaniro impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
