        {
          "text": "Bize bibabere icagezwe c’intahava ukw ibihe vy’urunganwe rwanyu bizogenda bikurikirana, yuko mu ngo zanyu zose mutazokwigera mugeza mu kanwa ibinure cank’ ubuseri.",
